{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39398","headline":"抚盈歌 · 韦庄","name":"抚盈歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤縠兮鸳绡，霞疏兮绮寮。\n玉庭兮春昼，金屋兮秋宵。\n愁瞳兮月皎，笑颊兮花娇。\n罗轻兮浓麝，室煖兮香椒。\n銮舆去兮萧屑，七丝断兮泬寥。\n主父卧兮漳水，君王幸兮云轺。\n铅华窅窈兮穠姿，棠公肸蠁兮靡依。\n翠华长逝兮莫追，晏相望门兮空悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}